    "description": "MUSCAT: Oman said Sunday it had rescued 23 crew members from a commercial ship while one was missing after the vessel was struck off the Gulf sultanate's eastern coast. \"Twenty-three crew members were rescued and provided with necessary medical care. Search operations are continuing for one crew member who remains missing,\" Oman's Maritime Security Center said in a statement.",
